    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>:</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math>              Bond order  <math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>:</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></math>              Bond order  <math><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>:</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></math>              Bond order  <math><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>  is less stable than  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>  because the incoming electron goes to anti bonding molecular orbital. So, the stability order is  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> .",
